Package: jaspGCEstim
Type: Package
Title: Entropy-Based Linear Regression for JASP
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Jorge", "Cabral", email = "jorgecabral@ua.pt", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A first JASP interface for weighted generalized cross-entropy linear
    regression using the GCEstim R package. This development version implements
    W-GCE with model, coefficient, signal support, and probability tables.
